---
// The site is light-only, like the landing page. With no ThemeSelect left in the header, this
// is all that stands between a visitor's OS dark preference and Starlight's unbranded dark
// theme, so it forces light and ignores both `prefers-color-scheme` and any stored preference.
---

{/* Inlined to avoid a flash of the wrong theme. */}
<script is:inline>
	document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';
</script>
